{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt22\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Any <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/viscous\" title=\"viscous\">viscous</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/liquid\" title=\"liquid\">liquid</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/paste\" title=\"paste\">paste</a>, such as a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/lubricant\" title=\"lubricant\">lubricant</a>, used in preparing a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/surface\" title=\"surface\">surface</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt24\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/absorbent\" title=\"absorbent\">absorbent</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/material\" title=\"material\">material</a> used to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/hold\" title=\"hold\">hold</a> a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/liquid\" title=\"liquid\">liquid</a>."},{"definition":""},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\"></span> Any <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/varnish\" title=\"varnish\">varnish</a> used to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/coat\" title=\"coat\">coat</a> a part, such as an <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/airplane\" title=\"airplane\">airplane</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/wing\" title=\"wing\">wing</a> or a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/hot-air\" title=\"hot-air\" class=\"mw-redirect\">hot-air</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/balloon\" title=\"balloon\">balloon</a> in order to <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/waterproof\" title=\"waterproof\">waterproof</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/strengthen\" title=\"strengthen\">strengthen</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/etc.\" title=\"etc.\">etc.</a>"},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt28\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Any of various recreational substances:\n\n<ol><li>An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/opiate\" title=\"opiate\">opiate</a>, now particularly <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/heroin\" title=\"heroin\">heroin</a>. <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r90144991\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\" about=\"#mwt30\">.mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}</style>\n</li>\n<li><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/marijuana\" title=\"marijuana\">Marijuana</a>.\n</li></ol>"},{"definition":"An <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/opiate\" title=\"opiate\">opiate</a>, now particularly <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/heroin\" title=\"heroin\">heroin</a>. <style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r90144991\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\" about=\"#mwt30\">.mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}</style>"},{"definition":"<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/marijuana\" title=\"marijuana\">Marijuana</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt41\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/information\" title=\"information\">Information</a>, usually from an inside source, originally in <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/horse_racing\" title=\"horse racing\">horse racing</a> and other sports. <link rel=\"mw-deduplicated-inline-style\" href=\"mw-data:TemplateStyles:r90144991\" about=\"#mwt42\" typeof=\"mw:Extension/templatestyles mw:Transclusion\">","parsedExamples":[{"example":"What's the latest <b>dope</b> on the stock market<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>"}],"examples":["What's the latest <b>dope</b> on the stock market<span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">?</span>"]},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt50\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Ballistic data on previously fired rounds, used to calculate the required hold over a target."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt51\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/stupid\" title=\"stupid\">stupid</a> person."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt56\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dessert\" title=\"dessert\">Dessert</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/topping\" title=\"topping\">topping</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt57\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> A soft drink."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt159\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/affect\" title=\"affect\">affect</a> with <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/drug\" title=\"drug\">drugs</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt163\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To treat with dope (lubricant, etc.)."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt164\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To add a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dopant\" title=\"dopant\">dopant</a> such as <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/arsenic\" title=\"arsenic\">arsenic</a> to (a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/pure\" title=\"pure\">pure</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/semiconductor\" title=\"semiconductor\">semiconductor</a> such as <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/silicon\" title=\"silicon\">silicon</a>)."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt166\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To use <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/drug\" title=\"drug\">drugs</a>; especially, to use prohibited performance-enhancing drugs (<a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/PED\" title=\"PED\">PEDs</a>) in sporting competitions."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt168\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> To <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/judge\" title=\"judge\">judge</a> or <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/guess\" title=\"guess\">guess</a>; to predict the result of.<!--W1913; compare noun senses-->"}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Adjective","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt226\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/amazing\" title=\"amazing\">Amazing</a>; <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/cool\" title=\"cool\">cool</a>.","parsedExamples":[{"example":"That party was <b>dope</b><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">!</span>"}],"examples":["That party was <b>dope</b><span typeof=\"mw:Entity\">!</span>"]}]}],"nl":[{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"Dutch","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt254\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"><span class=\"usage-label-sense\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#singular_number\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">singular</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#present_tense\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">present</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/Appendix:Glossary#subjunctive_mood\" title=\"Appendix:Glossary\">subjunctive</a> of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"nl\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/dopen#Dutch\" title=\"dopen\">dopen</a></i></span></span>"}]}],"fr":[{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"French","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt262\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/illicit\" title=\"illicit\">illicit</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/drug\" title=\"drug\">drug</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/narcotic\" title=\"narcotic\">narcotic</a>"}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Verb","language":"French","definitions":[{"definition":"<span class=\"form-of-definition use-with-mention\" about=\"#mwt264\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\">inflection of <span class=\"form-of-definition-link\"><i class=\"Latn mention\" lang=\"fr\"><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/doper#French\" title=\"doper\">doper</a></i></span>:</span><span about=\"#